# CSV files are RFC 4180: UTF-8 BOM + CRLF, produced by scripts/csv-pack.mjs
# on purpose so Excel / Numbers open Finnish diacritics and Chinese glosses
# correctly. A CR before LF is part of the line terminator, not a
# trailing space; without this, `git diff --check` reports ~1000 false
# positives on every imported row. Genuine trailing spaces are still flagged.
*.csv whitespace=cr-at-eol
